## DHCP Configuration

DC01 was configured as the DHCP server for the lab network.

### Scope

Network:
10.0.2.0/24

Address Pool:
10.0.2.100 - 10.0.2.200

DNS Server:
10.0.2.10

Domain:
corp.rosalietech.local

Static addresses below the DHCP pool were reserved for
infrastructure systems such as domain controllers and
file servers.
